{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"chapter_plan\": {\n    \"thesis\": \"肠道微生物组通过分类学特征、代谢产物及免疫通路调节实体瘤患者对ICI的临床疗效，但证据强度因癌种特异性、毒性表型（结肠炎vs心肌炎）及干预情境（供体特征、ICI骨架方案）而异。观察性关联在结肠炎中证据最强，心肌炎等罕见irAEs仍受限于样本量；微生物干预（如FMT）的获益与风险高度依赖于供体菌群组成与联合用药方案的交互作用。\",\n    \"reader_objective\": \"明确微生物组作为ICI毒性预测标志物的临床潜力与局限，理解疗效与毒性耦合/解耦的生物学基础，并掌握基于供体特征与ICI方案的情境化安全性管理策略。\",\n    \"units\": [\n      {\n        \"substantive_point\": \"特定菌属与irAEs的癌种特异性关联：微生物组特征对irAEs的预测价值并非普适，而是高度依赖肿瘤原发部位与局部解剖微环境。\",\n        \"ordered_development\": \"首先对比不同实体瘤中基线或动态微生物组与irAEs发生的关联谱，指出结肠炎证据最充分，而皮肤、神经及心脏毒性数据多呈碎片化。随后引入胃肠道癌症的特异性保护标志物，最后说明预测模型开发中的技术异质性与多重检验校正挑战。\",\n        \"paragraph_briefs\": [\n          {\n            \"point\": \"结肠炎型irAEs的微生物指纹与整体多样性下降\",\n            \"development\": \"比较结肠炎型与非结肠炎型irAE患者的粪便宏基因组/16S特征，指出主要产丁酸菌丰度降低、拟杆菌门/双歧杆菌减少及肠球菌富集是结肠炎的核心表型，并通过抗生素预处理小鼠FMT实验验证其因果致病潜力。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0017\"]\n          },\n          {\n            \"point\": \"胃肠道癌症的保护性菌群与器官特异性毒性差异\",\n            \"development\": \"聚焦食管癌、胃癌、结直肠癌队列，指出Ruminococcus callidus和Bacteroides xylanisolvens在无重症irAEs患者中显著富集，且尿素循环/精氨酸生物合成通路与低毒性相关；同时强调皮肤、血液、内分泌及肝脏毒性各自呈现独立的微生物通路特征，反驳单一通用标志物假设。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0011\"]\n          },\n          {\n            \"point\": \"预测模型的构建困境与统计效力限制\",\n            \"development\": \"评估基于机器学习（如RF14分类器）的irAEs预测模型性能，指出尽管AUC可达0.88，但在多重检验校正后部分特征显著性不足，且不同研究间测序平台、CTCAE分级版本及队列异质性导致模型泛化能力受限。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0308\", \"P0312\"]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"synthesis\": \"微生物组对irAEs的预测价值呈现显著的癌种与器官特异性，结肠炎表型的微生物驱动证据最为坚实，而其他毒性类型的独立预测标志物仍需大样本前瞻性队列验证。\",\n        \"transition\": \"在确认特定菌群与毒性关联的基础上，需进一步解析为何某些微生物特征既能促进抗肿瘤响应，又会引发过度免疫激活，从而引出疗效与毒性的耦合与解耦机制。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"substantive_point\": \"疗效与毒性的耦合及解耦关系：微生物组通过调节全身免疫基调（特别是Treg/Th17平衡与基线稳态），决定ICI诱导的免疫反应是精准清除肿瘤还是误伤正常组织。\",\n        \"ordered_development\": \"分析“双刃剑”效应下共享的免疫激活通路，探讨特定菌群实现“有效且无毒”状态的解耦可能性，引入纵向免疫细胞动态变化作为中介变量，解释基线免疫稳态如何设定毒性阈值。\",\n        \"paragraph_briefs\": [\n          {\n            \"point\": \"共享免疫激活通路的“双刃剑”效应\",\n            \"development\": \"指出高丰度Akkermansia muciniphila在NSCLC队列中与延长OS正相关，但同时增加irAEs风险，提示微生物介导的CD8+ T细胞活化与IFN-γ分泌是疗效提升与自身免疫毒性共有的上游驱动力。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0260\"]\n          },\n          {\n            \"point\": \"解耦路径：特定菌属与无毒性响应的共存\",\n            \"development\": \"对比黑色素瘤纵向队列数据，发现Eubacterium siraeum高丰度与无irAEs的客观缓解状态显著相关，且短链脂肪酸产生菌（如Coprococcus comes, Blautia glucerasea）在未发生irAEs的患者中同样富集，挑战“毒性必然预示疗效”的直觉假设。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0239\", \"P0428\"]\n          },\n          {\n            \"point\": \"基线免疫稳态与纵向动态变化的中介作用\",\n            \"development\": \"整合黑色素瘤配对粪便与外周血PBMC纵向数据，显示基线拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）高丰度与治疗后Tregs频率显著下降相关，且Tregs耗竭程度直接预测严重irAEs的发生；相反，瘤胃球菌科（Ruminococcaceae）主导的基线状态则与更好的治疗响应及较低的毒性风险同步出现。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0098\"]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"synthesis\": \"疗效与毒性的耦合源于微生物驱动的广谱免疫激活，而解耦则依赖于特定共生菌维持的Treg稳态与屏障完整性；基线免疫细胞亚群比例可作为区分“有益激活”与“病理性炎症”的关键中介指标。\",\n        \"transition\": \"当微生物干预被用于逆转耐药或增强疗效时，其安全性表现并非均一，而是强烈依赖于供体来源特征与联合使用的ICI药物骨架，这构成了本章第三部分的实证核心。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"substantive_point\": \"微生物干预的安全性与供体特征的情境依赖性：FMT等干预策略的临床活性受供体微生物组聚类与ICI治疗方案的双重调节，特定供体菌株仅在特定免疫阻断背景下触发严重毒性。\",\n        \"ordered_development\": \"以FMT-LUMINate II期试验为核心案例，详细解读单药与双药背景下的ORR与毒性谱差异；深入剖析供体无监督聚类结果，揭示富含Prevotella spp.的Cluster B供体与加速发作心肌炎的因果关联；补充益生菌双向作用及常规药物（抗生素/PPI）的干扰信号。\",\n        \"paragraph_briefs\": [\n          {\n            \"point\": \"FMT-LUMINate试验的疗效分化与毒性起病时间提前\",\n            \"development\": \"报告NSCLC队列（抗PD-1单药）ORR达80%且无≥3级AEs；而黑色素瘤队列（抗PD-1+抗CTLA-4双免）ORR为75%，但65%患者经历≥3级AEs，其中腹泻/结肠炎占20%，心肌炎发生率高达15%（文献报道通常<1%），且严重毒性中位起病时间提前至40天。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0583\"]\n          },\n          {\n            \"point\": \"供体微生物组聚类与特定毒性事件的因果关联\",\n            \"development\": \"基于Bray-Curtis指数无监督聚类将健康供体分为Cluster A与Cluster B（含供体5、11）。Cluster B以Segatella copri、Prevotella sp. Marseille-P4119等高丰度为特征。接受Cluster B供体FMT的黑色素瘤患者中，这些菌属显著富集并与≥3级AEs强相关；进一步流式分析显示S. copri定植与外周血CD4+ T细胞亚群比例增加相关，且该毒性仅在双ICI背景下显现，单药抗PD-1治疗中未观察到类似风险。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0583\"]\n          },\n          {\n            \"point\": \"益生菌的双向调节与伴随用药的干扰效应\",\n            \"development\": \"指出特定共生菌（如LGG）可通过释放脂磷壁酸激活巨噬细胞保护肠上皮，但在免疫抑制状态下存在机会性感染风险；同时汇总药物警戒数据，显示PPI联用可能增加肝胆及皮肤毒性报告率，而近期广谱抗生素暴露不仅削弱疗效，还独立增加严重结肠炎风险。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0040\", \"P0088\", \"P0310\"]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"synthesis\": \"微生物干预的安全性具有严格的情境依赖性：供体菌群特征（如Prevotella富集）与ICI骨架（双免 vs 单免）的交互作用是触发加速发作心肌炎等严重irAEs的决定性因素，提示未来FMT试验必须建立基于供体聚类的风险分层筛选标准。\",\n        \"transition\": \"上述临床表型与干预结果的背后，隐藏着从肠道屏障破坏到远端器官免疫风暴的多层次分子通路，下一章将系统拆解介导这些毒性效应的具体生物学机制。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"substantive_point\": \"介导毒性的分子与免疫通路：微生物组通过破坏物理屏障、分泌异常代谢物、触发分子模拟及放大细胞因子网络，系统性重塑宿主免疫耐受边界。\",\n        \"ordered_development\": \"按病理生理层级展开：首先阐述菌群失调导致的内毒素易位与TLR/NF-κB通路激活；其次分析关键代谢物（SCFAs、甲萘醌）对表观遗传与炎症信号的调控；接着结合动物模型与人类转录组数据，解析MyD88依赖的髓系/CD8+ T细胞炎症级联及分子模拟机制。\",\n        \"paragraph_briefs\": [\n          {\n            \"point\": \"肠道屏障受损与内毒素易位的促炎级联\",\n            \"development\": \"描述Akkermansia等黏液降解菌减少或致病菌扩张导致的紧密连接蛋白（ZO-1, Occludin）表达下调，促使LPS入血并持续激活TLR4/NF-κB通路，为全身性irAEs提供持续的先天免疫刺激背景。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0217\"]\n          },\n          {\n            \"point\": \"代谢物介导的表观遗传重编程与炎症抑制/促进\",\n            \"development\": \"指出非irAEs患者肠道中甲萘醌（维生素K2）生物合成途径（menH/menC基因）显著富集，血清甲萘醌水平更高，其可能通过抑制NF-κB通路发挥抗炎保护作用；反之，SCFAs在特定浓度下可通过HDAC抑制影响Treg/Th17分化平衡，剂量依赖性决定了其是维持稳态还是加剧炎症。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0308\", \"P0472\"]\n          },\n          {\n            \"point\": \"MyD88依赖的髓系激活与心肌炎中的CD8+ T细胞TNF轴\",\n            \"development\": \"综合临床前与转录组证据，阐明微生物抗原通过MyD88通路激活巨噬细胞分泌TNFα/IL-6导致肝损伤，或在ICI心肌炎中驱动CD8+ T细胞释放TNF并通过TNFR2信号招募髓系细胞、诱发心律失常；结合HLA限制性抗原呈递框架，指出细菌肽段（如β-半乳糖苷酶）与心脏肌球蛋白的分子模拟可交叉激活自体反应性CD4+/CD8+ T细胞。\",\n            \"source_handles\": [\"P0126\", \"P0149\", \"P0597\"]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"synthesis\": \"微生物介导的irAEs并非单一通路所致，而是屏障完整性丧失、代谢物信号失衡、分子模拟触发的交叉反应以及MyD88/TNF炎症级联共同作用的结果；理解这些通路有助于开发靶向特定节点（如TNFR2阻断、甲萘醌补充）的精准毒性管理策略。\",\n        \"transition\": \"综上所述，微生物组对ICI毒性的调节是一个多层次、情境依赖的系统工程。后续章节将基于本章确立的证据等级与机制框架，转向方法学挑战与未来标准化研究方向。\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```","reasoning_content":"Here's a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    *   **Role/Task:** Academic review planning editor. Goal: Create a well-argued, long-form review chapter plan in Chinese. Paper titles and proper nouns can remain in English. Do not write as a Q&A list.\n    *   **Scope Constraints:** Focus on substantive knowledge/analysis for the chapter body. Exclude intro/outro/abstract/final summary (handled by independent modules). Include necessary background/concepts/theory/mechanisms/method comparisons/future directions as needed. Each chapter must have a clear analytical task/question. Determine scope, perspective, and division of labor, but don't make them an introductory chapter.\n    *   **Structural Requirements:** Chapter organization determined by research question/context/materials. No single paradigm forced. Organize theory/concept/methodology/design by actual argument structure. Center on user's research question. Provide overarching perspective/synthesis judgment supported by material connections/differences/evolution. Judge relevance based on RQ/materials; don't overstate claims from expert reviews. Preserve original study types, objects, settings, conditions, methods, results, limits. Distinguish association vs. causation, mechanism/explanation, migration/application, validation/uncertainty. Don't confuse correlation with causation or cross-setting migration. Unmet needs only constrain current writing scope, don't upgrade to field-level absence. Correct overstatements. Route summaries/conflicts -> prioritize original `interpretation_limits`. Keep metadata/source handles. Use broad materials when evidence is sufficient, don't force-fit. Conditions must be integrated into `substantive_point`, `thesis`, `synthesis`, `transition` alongside claims/cases, not parked in a separate `limitations` field. Don't rank effects across different settings without conditions. Chapter titles in Chinese. Return JSON only.\n    *   **Chapter Plan Structure:** `chapter_plan` with `thesis`, `reader_objective`, ordered `units`. Each unit has: (1) substantive point, (2) ordered development, (3) concrete studies/cases with `source_handle` + research object/setting, (4) material-supported relations/conditions/limits, (5) evidence conditions/limits kept with claims, (6) transition. Within units: `paragraph_briefs` (ordered list of paragraph tasks: specific point, development/comparison/reasoning, source_handles). Vary paragraph count based on material richness. Direct-source refs distinct from review-reported refs.\n    *   **Input Data:** The prompt contains a massive amount of shared outline, chapter details (`Ch6`), directed reads, excluded sources, purpose, scope, substantive threads, supplement requests, title, position, next/prev chapters, and a huge list of `source_materials` (P0011, P0017, P0029, P0040, P0049, P0051, P0062, P0072, P0082, P0088, P0098, P0119, P0120, P0124, P0126, P0136, P0144, P0146, P0148, P0164, P0165, P0171, P0182, P0192, P0197, P0202, P0212, P0214, P0217, P0225, P0231, P0239, P0248, P0253, P0255, P0259, P0260, P0261, P0267, P0273, P0278, P0284, P0304, P0308, P0310, P0312, P0313, P0314, P0316, P0319, P0322, P0325, P0333, P0338, P0341, P0353, P0357, P0358, P0361, P0363, P0372, P0383, P0385, P0409, P0417, P0423, P0428, P0433, P0434, P0447, P0451, P0454, P0460, P0461, P0462, P0464, P0472, P0486, P0504, P0505, P0530, P0543, P0554, P0563, P0564, P0565, P0567, P0583, P0585, P0592, P0595, P0596, P0597, P0598, P0599, P0600, P0601, P0602, P0603, P0604, P0605, etc.).\n    *   **Chapter Focus (Ch6):** \"微生物组与免疫治疗毒性的关联\" (Association between Microbiome and Immunotherapy Toxicity). Purpose: Systematically evaluate associations between gut microbiome features and ICI-induced irAEs, analyze efficacy-toxicity coupling/decoupling, and explore safety/context-dependency of microbial interventions (FMT, probiotics). Scope: Solid tumors (melanoma, NSCLC, RCC, GI cancers) on ICI. Baseline/dynamic microbiome vs irAEs (colitis, myocarditis, skin toxicity, etc.). Predictive value, efficacy-toxicity trade-off mechanisms, donor characteristics modulating toxicity. Excludes hematologic malignancies, pure epidemiological toxicity studies without microbiome data. Evidence grading explicit.\n    *   **Key Themes from Substantive Threads & Materials:**\n        1.  Taxonomic associations & organ-specificity (Colitis strongest, Myocarditis/Skin limited, GI cancer specificity like *R. callidus*, melanoma *P. copri*).\n        2.  Efficacy-Toxicity Coupling vs. Decoupling (e.g., *Akkermansia* high abundance -> better OS but higher irAE risk; *Eubacterium siraeum* -> response without irAEs; SCFA producers like *F. prausnitzii* -> no irAEs; baseline immune homeostasis/Treg balance as mediator).\n        3.  Intervention Safety & Context-Dependency (FMT-LUMINate trial: NSCLC ORR 80% safe; Melanoma dual-ICI ORR 75% but 65% severe AEs including myocarditis linked to *Prevotella*-rich donors; Cluster B analysis; context-dependency on ICI regimen). Probiotics bidirectional effects. Antibiotic/PPI interference.\n        4.  Mechanistic pathways for toxicity (Barrier disruption/LPS translocation -> TLR4/NF-κB; Metabolites -> SCFAs, Menaquinone/Vit K2 inhibiting NF-κB; Immune cell activation -> MyD88 pathway, CD8+ T cell TNF signaling in myocarditis; Molecular mimicry/cross-reactivity).\n    *   **Constraints Check:** Must integrate conditions into claims. No separate limitations block. Paragraph briefs must be specific. JSON only. Chinese output.\n\n2.  **Structure the Chapter Plan:**\n    *   **Thesis:** 肠道微生物组通过分类学特征、代谢产物及免疫通路调节实体瘤患者对ICI的临床疗效，但证据强度因癌种特异性、毒性表型（结肠炎vs心肌炎）及干预情境（供体特征、ICI骨架方案）而异。观察性关联在结肠炎中证据最强，心肌炎等罕见irAEs仍受限于样本量；微生物干预（如FMT）的获益与风险高度依赖于供体菌群组成与联合用药方案的交互作用。\n    *   **Reader Objective:** 明确微生物组作为ICI毒性预测标志物的临床潜力与局限，理解疗效与毒性耦合/解耦的生物学基础，并掌握基于供体特征与ICI方案的情境化安全性管理策略。\n    *   **Units (Ordered Development):**\n        1.  **特定菌属与irAEs的癌种特异性关联** (Taxonomic associations & organ-specificity)\n        2.  **疗效与毒性的耦合及解耦机制** (Coupling/Decoupling & Treg/immune homeostasis)\n        3.  **微生物干预的安全性与供体特征的情境依赖性** (Intervention safety & FMT-LUMINate donor clustering)\n        4.  **介导毒性的分子与免疫通路** (Mechanisms: barrier, metabolites, molecular mimicry, cytokine storms)\n    *   *Self-Correction/Refinement during structuring:* Need to ensure each unit has paragraph_briefs with specific points, development, and source_handles. Conditions must be woven into the claims. I will","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1791148675,"id":"chatcmpl-8f5bcaba-9bb3-93e4-a114-b6e2be5b0ffa","model":"qwen3.7-flash","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":4842,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2048,"text_tokens":4842},"prompt_tokens":351155,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"text_tokens":351155},"total_tokens":355997}}